<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>About&nbsp;WhiteFiber, Inc. </B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">WhiteFiber is a provider of AI infrastructure
solutions. WhiteFiber owns HPC data centers and provides cloud services to customers. Our vertically integrated model combines specialized
colocation, hosting, and cloud services engineered to maximize performance, efficiency, and margin for generative AI workloads.</P>

